Two files are missing that the build needs:
- LICENSE: dzil build aborts with the message from the bundle that no LICENSE is in the distribution. Fix: run dzil genlicense and then stage LICENSE - the stage is not optional, the bundle gathers only tracked files, so an untracked LICENSE fails with the identical message
- Changes: the file does not exist at all. The release test checks that the changelog has content, so it fails. Create it in CPAN format with the unreleased section at the top. The file starts with the current work, it is not a historical release list, and the unreleased section needs at least one entry line

Also open: neither lib/App/codefork.pm nor bin/codefork carries a version declaration, while the house rule wants one in every file under lib/ and in every script under bin/.

Done when dzil build runs clean.

